 'summary-memo':()=>openModal('Summary memorandum · illustrative draft',`<h3>${esc(C().name)} · FY ${E().year}</h3><div class="reference-block"><h4>Work performed</h4><p>Sample accounting and workpaper records linked to TB-v${E().sourceVersion} and package-v${E().packageRevision}.</p><h4>Review points</h4><p>${E().reviews.filter(r=>r.status!=='Cleared').length} remain open. Current clearances are specific to their recorded revisions.</p><h4>Significant matters and differences</h4><p>The original example includes a QAR 500 depreciation adjustment. Actual estimates, evidence evaluation, going concern, subsequent events and reporting conclusions require professional work.</p><h4>Conclusion</h4><p>Not a professional conclusion. This preview shows the required structure only.</p></div>`,btn('Close','close-modal')),
